 BUGS FOUND (by scenario)
================================================================================

 SCENARIO 02 - PgBouncer Exhaustion:
   * inject.sh: 60 flood connections insufficient - pool_size > 60, pool never saturated
   * validate.sh Check 3: Cannot connect to pgbouncer admin (auth required), always skipped
   * Impact: Injection doesn't actually break anything; validate can't detect saturation

 SCENARIO 04 - Docker Container Crash:
   * validate.sh Check 3: macOS date parsing bug (-d flag vs -jf)
   * validate.sh Check 5: psql_docker() missing PGPASSWORD, always fails
   *** Core checks (2, 4) work correctly for inject/restore detection

 SCENARIO 05 - WAL Disk Full:
   * inject.sh: ssh_primary runs df without sudo, fails on mode-700 pg_wal
   * inject.sh: Script exits with error - must inject manually
   * validate.sh Check 2: ssh_primary ls without sudo can't see files in pg_wal
   * Cleanup: rm glob expansion fails with >200 files; need find -delete

 SCENARIO 06 - Ansible Config Drift:
   * inject.sh: sed targets 172.31.0.0/16 but actual pg_hba.conf uses 0.0.0.0/0
   * CIDR injection has no effect - only the TRUST line injection works
   * validate.sh Check 4: Expects 172.31.0.0/16 which doesn't exist (always FAIL)
   * validate.sh Check 6: write_lag query returns empty (warns but doesn't fail)

 SCENARIO 07 - Slow Query Blocks Partitions:
   * validate.sh Check 2: Needs > 60s after injection to detect blocker
   * validate.sh Check 4: COMMENT doesn't need AccessExclusiveLock, so it always passes

 SCENARIO 08 - Monitoring Blackout:
   * validate.sh Check 3: When Prometheus is down, empty JSON parsed as 0 DOWN = false PASS
   * validate.sh Check 5: Replica lag threshold 5s too aggressive (normally 20-30s)
   * validate.sh Check 6: pg_exporter returns HTTP 302, not 200 (pre-existing)

 SCENARIO 10 - Automation Failure:
   * validate.sh Check 1: Threshold >= 2 nodes too low (should require all 4)
   * Replication stays streaming after pg_hba reject until connection drops (may take minutes)

 SCENARIO 11 - Monitoring Incident:
   * Prometheus lifecycle API returns 403 (--web.enable-lifecycle not set)
   * validate.sh Check 4: After restart, needs ~30s for all 8 targets to register

